        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "INVESTMENT PROPERTY\r\n\r\n7 GREEN STREET, GREENMOUNT, CORK\r\n\r\nFOR SALE BY DAN HOWARD & CO LTD AUCTIONEERS\r\n\r\nDan Howard & Co Ltd Auctioneers are delighted to present 7 Green Street to the market — a superb, income-producing investment opportunity in one of Cork's most sought-after rental locations.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned within easy walking distance of UCC and just moments from the city centre, this property is tailor-made for the student rental market, where demand consistently outstrips supply. Green Street enjoys a prime city-centre location, close to shops, restaurants, bars, and excellent transport links, making it equally attractive to student tenants and young  alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises 6 well-proportioned single bedrooms, 2 shower rooms, a spacious living room, and a kitchen/dining room — a layout designed to maximise rental income and occupancy.\r\n\r\nCurrently tenanted and producing a rental income in excess of €50,000 per annum, this property offers an incoming investor an immediate, strong-performing income stream from day one. As a further bonus, the property also benefits from a large advertising sign on the gable wall, providing an additional and rare source of passive income.\r\n\r\nA genuine turn-key investment opportunity in an unrivalled location — early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
